# FleetCare demo tour, all through the gateway.
# Run the requests in order with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client):
# later requests reuse ids from earlier responses.
# Start the system first: docker compose up --build --wait
# The plate must be unique: change it to run the tour a second time on the same data.

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@plate = GT518RX

### 1. Register an owner
# @name owner
POST {{gateway}}/api/owners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Anna",
  "lastName": "Verdi",
  "email": "anna.verdi.{{$timestamp}}@example.it",
  "phone": "+39 345 118 2290"
}

### 2. Register her car
# @name vehicle
POST {{gateway}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plate": "{{plate}}",
  "brand": "Fiat",
  "model": "Tipo",
  "productionYear": 2021,
  "fuelType": "DIESEL",
  "registrationDate": "2021-03-15",
  "ownerId": {{owner.response.body.$.id}}
}

### 3. Record an odometer reading
POST {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}/mileage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "readingDate": "2026-10-01",
  "km": 61250
}

### 4. Vehicle detail: owner, current km and inspection status
# Never inspected and registered over 4 years ago: the inspection is overdue.
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Book a brake job (the maintenance service checks the vehicle through OpenFeign)
# @name booking
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicle.response.body.$.id}},
  "serviceType": "BRAKES",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-01T09:00:00"
}

### 6. Booking the same vehicle at an overlapping time: 409 Conflict
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicle.response.body.$.id}},
  "serviceType": "OIL_CHANGE",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-01T10:00:00"
}

### 7. A Saturday: 422, the workshop is closed
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": {{vehicle.response.body.$.id}},
  "serviceType": "OIL_CHANGE",
  "startsAt": "2027-03-06T10:00:00"
}

### 8. Start the work
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.id}}/start

### 9. Complete it: the FLEET pricing strategy applies a 15% discount
POST {{gateway}}/api/bookings/{{booking.response.body.$.id}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Front brake pads and discs",
  "partsCost": 180.00,
  "labourHours": 2,
  "pricingPlan": "FLEET"
}

### 10. The vehicle's maintenance history
GET {{gateway}}/api/interventions?vehicleId={{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}

### 11. Notifications: the booking and the completed work, sent asynchronously
# @name notifications
GET {{gateway}}/api/notifications?unread=true&vehicleId={{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}

### 12. Mark the newest one as read
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/notifications/{{notifications.response.body.$.content[0].id}}/read

### 13. Run the daily inspection check now: the new car gets an "overdue" reminder
POST {{gateway}}/api/reminders/inspections

### 14. Running it again creates no duplicates
POST {{gateway}}/api/reminders/inspections

### 15. Reports (SQL window functions and a MongoDB aggregation pipeline)
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/brands/average-cost

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/monthly-spending

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/stats

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/vehicles/{{vehicle.response.body.$.id}}/mileage

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/events/stats?days=7
